 "details": "Everything comes from terminal/curriculum; no names of subjects, domains or topics appear here. A mode is a key on the highlighted topic, never a menu: Enter starts the first mode the topic has, V free practice, S cheat sheet, T 60 s, Z 20 sums, H table exercise; a key that does not apply does nothing. The footer shows only the keys of the highlighted topic and is clickable. After an exercise or cheat sheet you are back on the same topic. The 60-second mode only shows when the parent left the timer visible.",
